  - Descend to a safe above-top hover, then insert inward to just outside the tip, descend to grasp height, and slide a few centimeters back along −lever_long_dir so the bar sits between the open fingers. Then close.
  - Apply a 4 cm downward press to unlatch, then execute a two-part pull: first a 0.20 m outward pull; then 0.30 m additional outward pull with a −door_width_dir lateral bias (0.20 m) to better approximate a swing before retreating upward.

