- T2: Lower to above-top hover at same XY.
- T3: Insert inward to just outside the lever tip at above-top height.
- T4: Descend to grasp height at the tip.
- T5: Slide along −lever long-axis by 4 cm at grasp height to seat the bar in the jaws; then close the gripper.
- T6: Downward press by 4 cm to unlatch.
- T7: Outward pull 0.20 m to begin opening.
- T8: Continued outward pull 0.30 m with −door_width_dir lateral bias of 0.20 m to approximate a swing.
