- Phase 5: Small inward insertion at grasp height for seating, then close, outward seat tug.
- Phase 6: Downward press to unlatch.
- Phase 7–9: Multi-segment outward + lateral pull to open door.
- Phase 10: Vertical retreat to high hover; release.

